OL,3,GNEWSAOffshore wind plant to bring jobs
OL,4,Aboost to Montrose
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn offshore wind turbine facility is to
OL,7,Fbe created at the Port of Montrose,
OL,8,Fsupporting about 80 jobs.
OL,10,FThe factory, which will make components
OL,11,Ffor off-shore wind turbines, is to be
OL,12,Frun by engineering firm Subsea
OL,13,FMicropiles following a #5m investment.
OL,15,FA further #6.7m is being provided by
OL,16,Fthe state-owned Scottish National
OL,17,FInvestment Bank, with Scottish
OL,18,FEnterprise also pledging #1.45m.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
