OL,3,GNEWSAOffshore wind plant to bring jobs
OL,4,Aboost to Montrose
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister John Swinney, during a
OL,7,Fvisit to the site in Angus, said it
OL,8,Fwould help ensure "benefits of the
OL,9,Fenergy transition are retained in
OL,10,FScotland".
